                    {
                        "sense_id": "61008a64-c189-3f00-bfb3-a6102632353a",
                        "entry_id": "9d57d902-fefe-3629-9ef5-1053eed4ae22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The penis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dde3046-1817-44d3-b994-63bc01b38151",
                                "sense_id": "61008a64-c189-3f00-bfb3-a6102632353a",
                                "text": "\"That American girl was after you too, wasn't she?\"\n\"She didn't mean anything she said. She was just after your dong. But it's mine.\"\n\"For sure, Mary.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2973811-c2f9-4f2b-8362-e4cf202b8e24",
                                "sense_id": "61008a64-c189-3f00-bfb3-a6102632353a",
                                "text": "Nevertheless, I was wholly incapable of keeping my paws from my dong once it started the climb up my belly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb18be8b-fa3a-4c03-bfdd-8d208b3f0c24",
                                "sense_id": "61008a64-c189-3f00-bfb3-a6102632353a",
                                "text": "Isn't it awfully nice to have a penis?\nIsn't it frightfully good to have a dong?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18d1d22c-d358-3c98-9d75-0446a263680b",
